# Derived benchmark inputs. The dataset the manifest names is committed so a
# published result can be checked against real bytes; the clustered variants are
# regenerated from benchmarks/README.md, whose clustering recipe is the only thing
# needed to reproduce them, and at 300-750 MB they do not belong in the history.
benchmarks/data/**/*_clustered.h5ad
benchmarks/data/**/aida_pbmc_wide.h5ad

# A run directory is intermediate state, hundreds of MB of evidence tables and
# HTML reports. What is published is `benchmarks/results/<dataset>.<system>.json`,
# which is small, immutable, and hash-bound, and nothing here is one of those.
benchmarks/results/*/

docs/_build/
docs/_generated/
